Project value < £500?
  └─ YES → Fiverr (cheap, fast, fixed-scope)
  └─ NO ↓

Project scope clearly defined with deliverables?
  └─ YES → PPH or Upwork (proposal-based, fixed price)
  └─ NO (open-ended, ongoing) → Upwork (hourly contracts, time tracking)

Need ongoing relationship / virtual assistant?
  └─ Upwork (best infrastructure for long-term hourly)

Need specialist for one-off project?
  └─ PPH (curated, UK-skewed, higher quality bar)

Need cheap labor for low-complexity tasks?
  └─ Fiverr (lowest friction)

Budget > £10k and need senior talent?
  └─ Direct hire (recruiter or full-time) — platform fees exceed recruiter value at this scale
